    "title": "مونوگراف: Sudafed Sinus Decongestant (Pseudoephedrine Hydrochloride)",
    "title_en": "Sudafed Sinus Decongestant (Pseudoephedrine Hydrochloride) - Product Monograph",
    "content_html": "\n<div class=\"knowledge-card space-y-6 text-right\" dir=\"rtl\">\n  <!-- Brand & Molecule Header -->\n  <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/25\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between flex-wrap gap-2 mb-2\">\n      <span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400\">شناسنامه و مونوگراف فرآورده دارویی:</span>\n      <span class=\"text-xs font-mono font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-300\">S3</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"text-lg font-black text-foreground\">Sudafed Sinus Decongestant</div>\n    <div class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground font-mono mt-0.5\" dir=\"ltr\">Pseudoephedrine Hydrochloride (Pseudoephedrine HCl 60mg per tablet)</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Indications -->\n  <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-muted/40 border border-border space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"text-xs font-bold text-foreground\">🎯 موارد مصرف و اندیکاسیون‌های تاییدشده:</div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-foreground/90 leading-relaxed\">تسکین سریع احتقان بینی و سینوس‌ها ناشی از سرماخوردگی، آنفلوآنزا و آلرژی.</p>\n    <div class=\"text-[11px] text-muted-foreground font-sans mt-1 text-left\" dir=\"ltr\">Fast, effective relief from sinus and nasal congestion due to colds, flu, and allergies.</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Dosage Instructions -->\n  \n\n  <!-- CAL Labels & State Storage Badges -->\n  <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border space-y-3\">\n    <div class=\"text-xs font-bold text-foreground\">🏷️ برچسب‌های هشدار و راهنمای مصرف APF (CAL Labels):</div>\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 flex-wrap\">\n      \n        <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold border cursor-pointer hover:scale-105 transition bg-muted text-foreground\" data-doc-link=\"doc-cal-cal-14\">\n          🏷️ CAL-14: CAL-14\n        </span>\n        <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold border cursor-pointer hover:scale-105 transition bg-muted text-foreground\" data-doc-link=\"doc-cal-cal-12\">\n          🏷️ CAL-12: CAL-12\n        </span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Mechanism Link -->\n  \n\n  <!-- Counseling Points -->\n  \n  <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/25 space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"text-xs font-bold text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400\">💡 نکات حیاتی مشاوره داروساز به بیمار (Counseling Pearls):</div>\n    <ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 text-xs text-muted-foreground\">\n      <li>ثبت اجباری در سامانه آنلاین Project Stop با کارت شناسایی عکس‌دار و مشاوره مستقیم داروساز.</li>\n      <li>در فشار خون کنترل‌نشده، بیماری شدید عروق کرونر، مصرف مهارکننده‌های MAO و گلوکوم ممنوع است.</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Safety Warnings -->\n  \n\n  <!-- Equivalent Brands on Shelf -->\n  \n</div>",
    "content_en": "\n<div class=\"knowledge-card space-y-6 text-left\" dir=\"ltr\">\n  <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/25\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between flex-wrap gap-2 mb-2\">\n      <span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400\">Medicine Monograph &amp; Scheduling:</span>\n      <span class=\"text-xs font-mono font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-300\">S3</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"text-lg font-black text-foreground\">Sudafed Sinus Decongestant</div>\n    <div class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground font-mono mt-0.5\">Pseudoephedrine Hydrochloride (Pseudoephedrine HCl 60mg per tablet)</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-muted/40 border border-border space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"text-xs font-bold text-foreground\">🎯 Therapeutic Indications:</div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-foreground/90 leading-relaxed\">Fast, effective relief from sinus and nasal congestion due to colds, flu, and allergies.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  \n  <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/25 space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"text-xs font-bold text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400\">💡 Clinical Counseling Points:</div>\n    <ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground\">\n      <li>Mandatory Project Stop ID recording and direct clinical assessment by the pharmacist.</li>\n      <li>Avoid in uncontrolled hypertension, severe coronary artery disease, MAOIs, or glaucoma.</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n</div>",
