    "title_en": "CAL 12 - Do Not Exceed Recommended Dose",
    "content_html": "\n<div class=\"knowledge-card space-y-6 text-right\" dir=\"rtl\">\n  <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-rose-500/15 text-rose-950 dark:text-rose-300 border-rose-500/30 border space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"text-xs font-mono font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-background/80 text-foreground\">APF Standard Label</span>\n      <span class=\"text-xs font-bold\">CAL 12</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"text-base font-black text-foreground\">منع تجاوز از دوز مجاز</div>\n    <div class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\" dir=\"ltr\">Do Not Exceed Recommended Dose</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-muted/40 border border-border space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"text-xs font-bold text-foreground\">متن درج‌شده روی لیبل داروخانه:</div>\n    <p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground leading-relaxed\">«از مقدار و دوز توصیه شده روزانه فراتر نروید.»</p>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground italic font-sans text-left mt-1\" dir=\"ltr\">\"Do not exceed the recommended daily dose.\"</p>\n  </div>\n\n  \n</div>",
    "content_en": "\n<div class=\"knowledge-card space-y-6 text-left\" dir=\"ltr\">\n  <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-rose-500/15 text-rose-950 dark:text-rose-300 border-rose-500/30 border space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"text-xs font-mono font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-background/80 text-foreground\">APF Standard Label</span>\n      <span class=\"text-xs font-bold\">CAL 12</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"text-base font-black text-foreground\">Do Not Exceed Recommended Dose</div>\n    <div class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\" dir=\"rtl\">منع تجاوز از دوز مجاز</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-muted/40 border border-border space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"text-xs font-bold text-foreground\">Exact Auxiliary Label Text:</div>\n    <p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground leading-relaxed\">\"Do not exceed the recommended daily dose.\"</p>\n  </div>\n</div>",
    "preferred_language": "bilingual",
