    "title": "برچسب هشدار CAL 13: پرهیز از مصرف الکل",
    "title_en": "CAL 13 - Avoid Alcohol",
    "content_html": "\n<div class=\"knowledge-card space-y-6 text-right\" dir=\"rtl\">\n  <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-purple-500/15 text-purple-950 dark:text-purple-300 border-purple-500/30 border space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"text-xs font-mono font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-background/80 text-foreground\">APF Standard Label</span>\n      <span class=\"text-xs font-bold\">CAL 13</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"text-base font-black text-foreground\">پرهیز از مصرف الکل</div>\n    <div class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\" dir=\"ltr\">Avoid Alcohol</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-muted/40 border border-border space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"text-xs font-bold text-foreground\">متن درج‌شده روی لیبل داروخانه:</div>\n    <p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground leading-relaxed\">«همزمان با مصرف این دارو از نوشیدن مشروبات الکلی خودداری کنید.»</p>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground italic font-sans text-left mt-1\" dir=\"ltr\">\"Avoid alcohol while taking this medication.\"</p>\n  </div>\n\n  \n</div>",
    "content_en": "\n<div class=\"knowledge-card space-y-6 text-left\" dir=\"ltr\">\n  <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-purple-500/15 text-purple-950 dark:text-purple-300 border-purple-500/30 border space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"text-xs font-mono font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-background/80 text-foreground\">APF Standard Label</span>\n      <span class=\"text-xs font-bold\">CAL 13</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"text-base font-black text-foreground\">Avoid Alcohol</div>\n    <div class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\" dir=\"rtl\">پرهیز از مصرف الکل</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-muted/40 border border-border space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"text-xs font-bold text-foreground\">Exact Auxiliary Label Text:</div>\n    <p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground leading-relaxed\">\"Avoid alcohol while taking this medication.\"</p>\n  </div>\n</div>",
    "preferred_language": "bilingual",
