    "folder_id": "folder-mono-storage",
    "title": "قوانین نگهداری دارو در ایالت قلمرو شمالی (NT)",
    "title_en": "Northern Territory (NT) Pharmacy Medicine Storage Regulations",
    "content_html": "\n<div class=\"knowledge-card space-y-6 text-right\" dir=\"rtl\">\n  <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/25\">\n    <div class=\"text-xs font-bold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 mb-1\">قوانین و مقررات ایالتی استرالیا:</div>\n    <div class=\"text-base font-bold text-foreground\">قلمرو شمالی (NT) (NT)</div>\n    <div class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-0.5\" dir=\"ltr\">Northern Territory (NT)</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-muted/40 border-border border space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-foreground\">قانون نگهداری داروهای Pharmacy Medicine (Schedule 2):</span>\n      <span class=\"text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full font-bold bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-300\">\n        آزاد در دید داروساز\n      </span>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-foreground/90 leading-relaxed\">داروهای S2 در قفسه‌های خریدار با نظارت پرسنل داروخانه.</p>\n    <p class=\"text-[11px] text-muted-foreground text-left italic font-sans\" dir=\"ltr\">S2 items permitted on retail shelves under staff supervision.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-rose-500/10 border border-rose-500/25 space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"text-xs font-bold text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400\">قانون نگهداری داروهای Pharmacist Only (Schedule 3):</div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-rose-700 dark:text-rose-300 leading-relaxed\">داروهای S3 الزماً پشت کانتر دیسپنسری.</p>\n    <p class=\"text-[11px] text-muted-foreground text-left italic font-sans\" dir=\"ltr\">S3 items strictly behind dispensary counter.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>",
    "content_en": "\n<div class=\"knowledge-card space-y-6 text-left\" dir=\"ltr\">\n  <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/25\">\n    <div class=\"text-base font-bold text-foreground\">Northern Territory (NT) (NT)</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-muted/40 border border-border space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"text-xs font-bold text-foreground\">Schedule 2 (Pharmacy Medicine) Storage Law:</div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-foreground/90 leading-relaxed\">S2 items permitted on retail shelves under staff supervision.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-rose-500/10 border border-rose-500/25 space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"text-xs font-bold text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400\">Schedule 3 (Pharmacist Only) Storage Law:</div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-rose-700 dark:text-rose-300 leading-relaxed\">S3 items strictly behind dispensary counter.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>",
    "preferred_language": "bilingual",
