    "content_html": "<article class=\"knowledge-card mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-5 text-sm leading-7\" dir=\"rtl\">\n    <header class=\"rounded-2xl border border-primary/20 bg-primary/5 p-5\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold leading-8\">در نگارش بخش بحث (Discussion) گزارش‌های پژوهشی، ساختار سه مرحله‌ای TED مخفف کدام یک از گزینه‌های زیر است؟</h2>\n      <p class=\"mt-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground\" dir=\"ltr\">Source: lib/pharmacy-data.ts</p>\n    </header>\n    <dl class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/60 bg-card/50 p-3 leading-relaxed\"><dt class=\"font-semibold text-foreground mb-1\">id</dt><dd class=\"text-foreground/85\"><span>q5</span></dd></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/60 bg-card/50 p-3 leading-relaxed\"><dt class=\"font-semibold text-foreground mb-1\">module Id</dt><dd class=\"text-foreground/85\"><span>mod5</span></dd></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/60 bg-card/50 p-3 leading-relaxed\"><dt class=\"font-semibold text-foreground mb-1\">question</dt><dd class=\"text-foreground/85\"><span>در نگارش بخش بحث (Discussion) گزارش‌های پژوهشی، ساختار سه مرحله‌ای TED مخفف کدام یک از گزینه‌های زیر است؟</span></dd></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/60 bg-card/50 p-3 leading-relaxed\"><dt class=\"font-semibold text-foreground mb-1\">گزینه‌ها</dt><dd class=\"text-foreground/85\"><ul class=\"space-y-2 ps-5 list-disc\"><li class=\"leading-relaxed\"><dl class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/60 bg-card/50 p-3 leading-relaxed\"><dt class=\"font-semibold text-foreground mb-1\">id</dt><dd class=\"text-foreground/85\"><span>a</span></dd></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/60 bg-card/50 p-3 leading-relaxed\"><dt class=\"font-semibold text-foreground mb-1\">text</dt><dd class=\"text-foreground/85\"><span>Title, Experiment, Data</span></dd></div></dl></li><li class=\"leading-relaxed\"><dl class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/60 bg-card/50 p-3 leading-relaxed\"><dt class=\"font-semibold text-foreground mb-1\">id</dt><dd class=\"text-foreground/85\"><span>b</span></dd></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/60 bg-card/50 p-3 leading-relaxed\"><dt class=\"font-semibold text-foreground mb-1\">text</dt><dd class=\"text-foreground/85\"><span>Topic introducer, Explanation/Summary of paper, Discussion of what was done and concluded</span></dd></div></dl></li><li class=\"leading-relaxed\"><dl class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/60 bg-card/50 p-3 leading-relaxed\"><dt class=\"font-semibold text-foreground mb-1\">id</dt><dd class=\"text-foreground/85\"><span>c</span></dd></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/60 bg-card/50 p-3 leading-relaxed\"><dt class=\"font-semibold text-foreground mb-1\">text</dt><dd class=\"text-foreground/85\"><span>Toxicity, Efficacy, Dosage</span></dd></div></dl></li><li class=\"leading-relaxed\"><dl class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/60 bg-card/50 p-3 leading-relaxed\"><dt class=\"font-semibold text-foreground mb-1\">id</dt><dd class=\"text-foreground/85\"><span>d</span></dd></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/60 bg-card/50 p-3 leading-relaxed\"><dt class=\"font-semibold text-foreground mb-1\">text</dt><dd class=\"text-foreground/85\"><span>Text, Editing, Draft</span></dd></div></dl></li></ul></dd></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/60 bg-card/50 p-3 leading-relaxed\"><dt class=\"font-semibold text-foreground mb-1\">correct Option Id</dt><dd class=\"text-foreground/85\"><span>b</span></dd></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/60 bg-card/50 p-3 leading-relaxed\"><dt class=\"font-semibold text-foreground mb-1\">توضیح پاسخ</dt><dd class=\"text-foreground/85\"><span>در ساختار TED: T معرفی موضوع (Topic)، E خلاصه‌ای از محتوای مقاله (Explanation)، و D بحث دقیق در مورد کارهای انجام شده و نتیجه‌گیری (Discussion) است.</span></dd></div></dl>\n  </article>",
    "content_en": "<article class=\"knowledge-card mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-5 text-sm leading-7\" dir=\"ltr\">\n    <header class=\"rounded-2xl border border-primary/20 bg-primary/5 p-5\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold leading-8\">In writing research report discussions, what does the golden 3-step TED acronym stand for?</h2>\n      <p class=\"mt-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground\" dir=\"ltr\">Source: lib/pharmacy-data.ts</p>\n    </header>\n    <dl class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/60 bg-card/50 p-3 leading-relaxed\"><dt class=\"font-semibold text-foreground mb-1\">id</dt><dd class=\"text-foreground/85\"><span>q5</span></dd></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/60 bg-card/50 p-3 leading-relaxed\"><dt class=\"font-semibold text-foreground mb-1\">module Id</dt><dd class=\"text-foreground/85\"><span>mod5</span></dd></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/60 bg-card/50 p-3 leading-relaxed\"><dt class=\"font-semibold text-foreground mb-1\">question</dt><dd class=\"text-foreground/85\"><span>In writing research report discussions, what does the golden 3-step TED acronym stand for?</span></dd></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/60 bg-card/50 p-3 leading-relaxed\"><dt class=\"font-semibold text-foreground mb-1\">Options</dt><dd class=\"text-foreground/85\"><ul class=\"space-y-2 ps-5 list-disc\"><li class=\"leading-relaxed\"><dl class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/60 bg-card/50 p-3 leading-relaxed\"><dt class=\"font-semibold text-foreground mb-1\">id</dt><dd class=\"text-foreground/85\"><span>a</span></dd></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/60 bg-card/50 p-3 leading-relaxed\"><dt class=\"font-semibold text-foreground mb-1\">text</dt><dd class=\"text-foreground/85\"><span>Title, Experiment, Data</span></dd></div></dl></li><li class=\"leading-relaxed\"><dl class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/60 bg-card/50 p-3 leading-relaxed\"><dt class=\"font-semibold text-foreground mb-1\">id</dt><dd class=\"text-foreground/85\"><span>b</span></dd></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/60 bg-card/50 p-3 leading-relaxed\"><dt class=\"font-semibold text-foreground mb-1\">text</dt><dd class=\"text-foreground/85\"><span>Topic introducer, Explanation/Summary of paper, Discussion of what was done and concluded</span></dd></div></dl></li><li class=\"leading-relaxed\"><dl class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/60 bg-card/50 p-3 leading-relaxed\"><dt class=\"font-semibold text-foreground mb-1\">id</dt><dd class=\"text-foreground/85\"><span>c</span></dd></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/60 bg-card/50 p-3 leading-relaxed\"><dt class=\"font-semibold text-foreground mb-1\">text</dt><dd class=\"text-foreground/85\"><span>Toxicity, Efficacy, Dosage</span></dd></div></dl></li><li class=\"leading-relaxed\"><dl class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/60 bg-card/50 p-3 leading-relaxed\"><dt class=\"font-semibold text-foreground mb-1\">id</dt><dd class=\"text-foreground/85\"><span>d</span></dd></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/60 bg-card/50 p-3 leading-relaxed\"><dt class=\"font-semibold text-foreground mb-1\">text</dt><dd class=\"text-foreground/85\"><span>Text, Editing, Draft</span></dd></div></dl></li></ul></dd></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/60 bg-card/50 p-3 leading-relaxed\"><dt class=\"font-semibold text-foreground mb-1\">correct Option Id</dt><dd class=\"text-foreground/85\"><span>b</span></dd></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/60 bg-card/50 p-3 leading-relaxed\"><dt class=\"font-semibold text-foreground mb-1\">Answer explanation</dt><dd class=\"text-foreground/85\"><span>TED stands for Topic introducer, Explanation of the source paper, and Discussion of what researchers did and concluded.</span></dd></div></dl>\n  </article>",
